   "DSL Google account 3456575686 returns No results found for the whole 2025-09-22..2025-10-19 window and records no walk-in actions in 2026. Its Google yoy, LY series and walk-in panel are zero by fact, not by fetch failure",
   "DSL Meta returned an empty data array for the whole 2025-09-22..2025-10-19 window, so Meta yoy spend and schedules at DSL are zero by fact (no delivery, pre-rebrand)",
   "Hutong action \"Hutong UK - GA4 (web) sevenrooms_booking_complete\" (55.70 this week) excluded per the no-ga4 rule; \"Sevenrooms Booking Complete\" is the venue booking action. DSL action \"Purchase (Google Analytics event sevenrooms_finish_search_page)\" is not a booking-complete action and is excluded",
